opencode/plugins/*/*.tgz

# Python bytecode left behind by the skill test suites
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# MSBuild output from the `plan_lint` fixture repos (left behind by dotnet test runs)
skills/*/tests/fixtures/**/bin/
skills/*/tests/fixtures/**/obj/

# PDCA: `.pdca/status/**` is the durable on-disk record (not ignored) — it persists and is read back
# by a fresh session, which does not make it Git-tracked: adding, staging or committing it needs an
# explicit user/policy instruction. Evidence and staged helpers are local by-products of a run
# (docs/install.md); a numeric `rv<k>` under a task/collection id is covered at any depth,
# nested collection items included, without hiding a durable `.pdca/rv-tests/` root.
.pdca/*/**/rv[0-9]*/
.pdca/scripts/
